&lt;p&gt;   As most of the development works are on Kylin 4, we need to switch it as main branch. Apache Kylin community changes the branch settings on Github since 2021-08-04 :&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   1. The default branch &lt;em&gt;main&lt;/em&gt; is for *&lt;b&gt;Kylin 4.x&lt;/b&gt;* (Parquet storage);&lt;br/&gt;
   2. The original branch &lt;em&gt;master&lt;/em&gt; for *&lt;b&gt;Kylin 3.x&lt;/b&gt;* (HBase storage) has been renamed to *&lt;b&gt;kylin3&lt;/b&gt;* ;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   Please check &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Intro to Kylin 4 architecture&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://kylin.apache.org/blog/2021/07/02/Apache-Kylin4-A-new-storage-and-compute-architecture/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://kylin.apache.org/blog/2021/07/02/Apache-Kylin4-A-new-storage-and-compute-architecture/&lt;/a&gt;) and &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;INFRA-22166&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/INFRA-22166&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/INFRA-22166&lt;/a&gt;) if you are interested.&lt;/p&gt;

